  {
    "lesson_id": "039",
    "trigger_word": "kuanzisha",
    "trigger_card_number": 1,
    "header_color": "magenta",
    "title": "第39课：使发生：-ISHA",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Kuanzisha. Kusomesha. Kulisha."
        },
        "content": [
          "后缀 -ish-/-esh- 把“做”变成",
          "“让某人做”：",
          "",
          "   kuanza     开始",
          "   kuanzisha  创立，使开始",
          "",
          "",
          "   kusoma     阅读，学习",
          "   kusomesha  供某人上学",
          "",
          "",
          "   kula       吃",
          "   kulisha    喂养",
          "",
          "听发音：                              按 1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Alianzisha kampuni yake. Wazazi wanamsomesha binti yao."
        },
        "content": [
          "在句子中，被促使的人变成宾语——",
          "通常像第23课所教那样内嵌其中：",
          "",
          "",
          "   Alianzisha kampuni yake.",
          "   他创立了自己的公司。",
          "",
          "   Wazazi wanamsomesha binti yao.",
          "   父母正在供女儿上学。",
          "",
          "",
          "听发音：                              按 1",
          "",
          "已学六种扩展：-w-、-ik-、-an-、",
          "ji-、-i-、-ish-。有了这个词缀，",
          "这台机器就完整了。"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "040",
    "trigger_word": "kusimamia",
    "trigger_card_number": 2,
    "header_color": "cyan",
    "title": "第40课：为他人做：-IA/-EA",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Kuletea. Muuguzi ananiletea dawa. Mama anawapikia watoto."
        },
        "content": [
          "监管就是为他人而站立：",
          "kusimama + -i- = kusimamia。这就是",
          "施用式：词尾 -a 前加 -i-/-e-。",
          "",
          "   kuleta    带来",
          "   kuletea   带给某人",
          "",
          "   kupika    烹饪",
          "   kupikia   为某人烹饪",
          "",
          "   Muuguzi ananiletea dawa.",
          "   护士给我带来药。",
          "",
          "   Mama anawapikia watoto.",
          "   妈妈为孩子们做饭。",
          "",
          "听这些句子：                          按 1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Kusomea. Ninakuandikia barua."
        },
        "content": [
          "元音需和谐：含 e 或 o 的词根用 -e-，",
          "其余用 -i-：",
          "",
          "   kusoma  -> kusomea   为……学习",
          "   kuandika -> kuandikia 给……写",
          "",
          "   Ninakuandikia barua.",
          "   我正在给你写信。",
          "",
          "听这些句子：                          按 1",
          "",
          "目前已学五个词缀：-w-、-ik-、",
          "-an-、ji-，以及 -i-；使役 -ish-",
          "将为本级收尾。本卡组的每个动词",
          "都是这些词缀在起作用：读懂词缀，",
          "就懂了动词。"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
